  "prefLabel": "Ins 2706.25 Option for Self-Funded Plans to Opt Into the State IDR Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2706.25 Option for Self-Funded Plans to Opt Into the State IDR Process. Self-funded group plans, government plans, and church plans not otherwise subject to this part shall have the opportunity to opt into the state IDR process and be subject to the provisions of this part. Plans wishing to opt in under this provision shall complete an opt in form and shall register under Ins 2706.24. Plans that have opted in under this provision may subsequently opt out by completing an opt out form.\n\nSource. #14559, eff 4-22-26, EXPIRES: 4-22-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2700.html"
}
